    "title": "Construct Distanced Sequence",
    "category": "Backtracking",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Construct a sequence of length 2N\u22121 using the integers 1 to N such that: \u2022 Integer 1 appears exactly once. \u2022 Every integer 2...N appears exactly twice. \u2022 The two occurrences of integer i are exactly i positions apart. Return the lexicographically largest valid sequence.",
